Extended the composite generator to parse component-level transforms, tag `component_id`, and emit `components_json` in samples, plus component-aware coloring/legends in viz. Added five composite presets and taxonomy_v2 entries, updated schema/CSV coercion for new columns, and documented the DSL with a deterministic transform test.

Tests not run (not requested).

